cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this repository and the exact commit used. A public release date and DOI are not asserted by this candidate."
type: software
title: "Patoshi Timing Audit: A Reproducible Correction to the 2022 Timing Test"
authors:
  - family-names: Easterbrook
    given-names: Zakk
repository-code: "https://github.com/zakkeasterbrook/-patoshi-timing-audit"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible audit of a published Bitcoin block-timing test. It reproduces
  the original PHP output, isolates a wrong timestamp assignment, and implements
  the stated sequence rule over 50,000 verified block headers with fixed labels.
  Descriptive timing and nonce comparisons are kept separate from miner identity
  and causal claims.
keywords:
  - Bitcoin
  - reproducibility
  - block timestamps
  - Patoshi
version: 1.0.0-rc.1
